an class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-zdghfau elementor-section-content-middle elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"zdghfau\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-wide\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-43ba58ae\" data-id=\"43ba58ae\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-66 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-15249d1d\" data-id=\"15249d1d\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1b44e2d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1b44e2d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">OUR STORY<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-02d3e11 elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"02d3e11\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-13a9b180 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"13a9b180\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Citrus Capital was inspired by the luscious growth of the citrus trees in Southern California. This reflects exactly who we are \u2013 passionate people, with fresh ideas, delivered with excitement and clarity.\u00a0<\/p><p>Since its inception in 2012, Citrus has offered a wide variety of support to a wide variety of businesses. Our experience includes work in retail, speciality manufacturing, technology, real estate, construction services, corporate finance, master planning and economic development, energy and private equity. We have guided businesses from start up to shareholder successions, acquisitions to new market expansion and private equity investment.<br \/>We are entrepreneurs, working with other entrepreneurs, and we get it. We\u2019ve been there too.<\/p><p>Whether you\u2019re stuck in the grind, wearing too many hats, overworked or looking to others for answers. We learned that the power of collaboration and alignment leads to exceptional business outcomes and we are here to help.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-b42prlf elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"b42prlf\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-14115da3\" data-id=\"14115da3\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-29baaefc elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"29baaefc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">OUR EXPERIENCE\n<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3f6f62b0 elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"3f6f62b0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-29bdfd1d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"29bdfd1d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We have experience managing, growing, and financing small to medium-sized businesses, making Citrus Capital the go-to resource for entrepreneurs looking to take their business to the next level.\u00a0<span style=\"font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; background-color: var( --e-global-color-astglobalcolor4 ); color: var(--ast-global-color-3);\">Our experience includes work in corporate finance, private equity, energy, technology, retail, CPG, real estate, speciality manufacturing, marketing, master planning and economic development. We have guided businesses through acquisitions and divestitures, shareholder successions, private equity investment, and more.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-xgr9wc8 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"xgr9wc8\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-6ef516d5\" data-id=\"6ef516d5\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7b312b02 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7b312b02\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">COMMUNITY INVOLVEMENT<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-46b1abf6 elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"46b1abf6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-43e96b94 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"43e96b94\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Volunteering in the community has always been a core value of the Citrus Capital team. Our team has long been involved in community organizations such as <a href=\"https:\/\/www.ywcalgary.ca\/\"><b>YW Calgary<\/b><\/a>,\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.rotaryclubofcalgary.org\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Rotary Club of Calgary<\/strong> <strong>Downtown<\/strong><\/a>,\u00a0<strong><a href=\"https:\/\/beakerhead.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Beakerhead<\/a>,<\/strong>\u00a0<strong><a href=\"http:\/\/cochraneminorhockey.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cochrane Minor Hockey Association<\/a><\/strong>,\u00a0<strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.calgarychamber.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Calgary Chamber<\/a><\/strong>,\u00a0<strong><a href=\"http:\/\/www.belocal.org\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">REAP<\/a>\u00a0<\/strong>and the\u00a0<strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ucalgary.ca\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">University of Calgary<\/a><\/strong>. We give back where we live and we believe that we can go further together.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>About Us OUR STORY Citrus Capital was inspired by the luscious growth of the citrus trees in Southern California. This reflects exactly who we are \u2013 passionate people, with fresh ideas, delivered with excitement and clarity.\u00a0 Since its inception in 2012, Citrus has offered a wide variety of support to a wide variety of businesses. [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"site-sidebar-layout":"no-si